1
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,600
我看起来怎么样
Well, how do I look?

2
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:07,510
非常重要的一天 我要去见艾丽克斯
Big day. I'm going to see Alex.

3
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:10,030
我 我有点紧张
I'm, uh -- I'm a little nervous

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,390
因为她最近有点疏远我们
because she's been pulling away lately.

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,260
打电话也不回
Calls don't get returned.

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,850
也不像以前那样经常要我去看她了
I don't get asked to visit as much.

7
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,330
我有点承受不来
Maybe it's hitting me hard

8
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,780
可能是因为我和我爸从没有过类似情况
'cause I never went through that with my dad.

9
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:19,690
我上完第一年
After my junior year,

10
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:22,290
我们一起骑双人自行车穿过米克诺斯岛
we -- we rode a tandem bike across Mykonos.

11
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:22,960
仔细想想
Come to think of it,

12
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,000
那里有好多父子
there were lots of fathers and sons there.

13
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,590
菲尔 坐下
Phil, sit.

14
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:29,380
我们得谈谈鸭子的事情
We need to talk about the ducks.

15
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,870
我们讨厌那些鸭子
We hate the ducks.

16
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,280
又来 你有麻烦了
Again? You have a problem.

17
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,390
我听到不少抱怨
I'm hearing a lot of negatives,

18
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:47,760
但我们都忽略了小羽会捡东西的事实
but we're overlooking the fact that Feathers can now fetch.

19
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,950
亲爱的 它从水槽拖出了个湿漉漉的热狗面包
Honey, she pulled a wet hot dog bun out of the sink,

20
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:50,910
然后你才说"去捡面包"
and you said, "get the bun."

21
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:52,390
那可不算是捡东西
That doesn't count as fetching.

22
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:54,360
拜托别告诉它们要一直待在这里
Please tell me they're not gonna live here forever.

23
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,140
你可不配说这个
You're really not the one to make that argument.

24
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:56,870
说得你好像不会
Oh, like you're not gonna

25
00:00:56,870 --> 00:00:58,750
睡在楼上那张双层床直到老死一样
die of natural causes in that bunk bed upstairs.

26
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:01,240
听着 我们给了它们一个美好的家
Look, we have provided them with a good home.

27
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,450
等它们准备好了 自然就会走了
When they're ready, they'll leave.

28
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:04,520
随时有可能
Could be any day.

29
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:06,290
顺便替鸭子说句公道话 克莱尔
Oh, and in the duck's defense, Claire,

30
00:01:06,290 --> 00:01:08,250
你不能在吃早饭时故意把腿露在外面
You can't stick your leg out of your robe at breakfast

31
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:10,100
然后还假装讨厌别人看你
and then pretend to hate the attention.

32
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,130
你怎么没有努力抗争一下
Why didn't you fight harder about the ducks?

33
00:01:13,130 --> 00:01:14,720
你听到他说了的吧
You heard what he said.

34
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:17,190
鸭子现在随时都有可能离开
The ducks could leave any day now.

35
00:01:17,190 --> 00:01:19,740
是啊 也可能要到两个月后
Yeah, or it could be two months from now.

36
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:21,940
或者现在随时
Or any day now.

37
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:22,730
或者一个多月...
Or a month and a half fr--

38
00:01:22,730 --> 00:01:24,240
你怎么就不明白呢
How are you not getting this?

39
00:01:37,490 --> 00:01:39,310
米奇打电话问你什么时候把充气床垫带过去
Mitch called. He wants to know when are you bringing

40
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:41,310
好让莉莉的朋友来家里过夜
the air mattress for Lily's sleepover.

41
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:43,680
对于一个不肯自己买充气床垫的人来说
You know, for a guy who refuses to buy his own air mattresses,

42
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,020
他倒是很挑剔气垫什么时候送到啊
he's pretty particular about when they arrive.

43
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,260
不不不 别吃我的酱
No, no! Don't eat my sauce.

44
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:50,090
吃了就不够我拿去农夫市场上卖了
Then I won't have enough to sell at the farmers' market.

45
00:01:50,090 --> 00:01:52,070
别 天哪 别戳我的嘟嘟肉
No. Oh, geez. Not the fat finger.

46
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:54,240
你总爱在我长胖时这么戳戳戳
You always do this when I put on a few.

47
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,490
我可什么都没说
I didn't say anything.

48
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:56,500
你说没说什么不重要
It's not what you say.

49
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:59,090
是你这该死的量油尺般的手指
It's that damn lard dipstick finger of yours.

50
00:01:59,090 --> 00:02:01,150
第二指关节都陷进去了
It disappeared up to the second knuckle.

51
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:02,230
既然你们说完了
Well, now that that's over with,

52
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:05,050
我可以跟你们聊聊跟橄榄球有关的问题了吧
I can finally share my latest football-related problem.

53
00:02:05,050 --> 00:02:06,620
米奇尔说得对 也许我是该送过去了
Mitchell's right. I should probably get a move on.

54
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:08,920
球队没有带我一起搞季末恶作剧
The team left me out of the end-of-the-season prank.

55
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,190
这让我想起了以前
You know, that takes me back.

56
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:13,150
我们跟学校董事会告状说戴维斯教练是个共产党
We told the school board that coach Davis was a communist.

57
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,150
结果害那家伙吃了两天牢饭
The man spent a weekend in jail.

58
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,820
多么简单粗暴
Simpler times.

59
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,890
那也比这些个白痴干的好啊
Well, that's better than what these meatheads cooked up.

60
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,060
他们只不过把校长的车
They just parked the principal's car

61
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:21,760
停在了篮球场中央
in the middle of the basketball court.

62
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:24,770
不应该把车停那里啊
That's not where cars go.

63
00:02:25,410 --> 00:02:27,620
这些混蛋为什么不带上你
Why didn't those meatballs include you?

64
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,470
他们嫌我自命清高
They think I'm a goody-two-shoes.

65
00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:31,360
我没有啊
I'm not.

66
00:02:32,130 --> 00:02:33,330
连我自己老妈都这么说吗
My own mother?

67
00:02:33,330 --> 00:02:36,050
我只说你偶尔犯点法也不会怎么样
Ay, I'm just saying it wouldn't kill you to break some rules.

68
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:37,920
你是个未成年人 要好好利用这一点
You're a minor. Take advantage of it.

69
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,870
我也会犯法啊
I break the rules.

70
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:42,120
我只是喜欢考究点的 要有派头又有手段的
I just prefer to be suave, do it with panache and finesse.

71
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,310
那些是美国的洗发水 我知道
Ay, those are American shampoos. I know.

72
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:46,260
准备好听这个消息了吗
Y'all ready for this?

73
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:48,050
我把我们的酱
I got our sauce

74
00:02:48,050 --> 00:02:50,740
推销给了老爷爷节日礼品篮[礼品篮业的老祖]
into The Granddaddy of All Holiday gift baskets.

75
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:51,560
哪一个
Which one?

76
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,360
就叫做老爷爷节日礼品篮
It's called Granddaddy's Holiday Gift Baskets.

77
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,800
非常高级
Very exclusive.

78
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,750
他们要150罐
They want 150 jars...

79
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,300
今晚六点就要
6 o'clock tonight.

80
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:00,970
不行 这么短时间内做不出那么多啊
No! It's too much sauce for too little time.

81
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:03,200
而且我也没有关键食材了
And anyways, I don't have the key ingredient --

82
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,340
大红椒
The blood peppers.

83
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:05,570
我的堂兄要到下礼拜
And my cousin can't send me more

84
00:03:05,570 --> 00:03:07,060
才能从哥伦比亚给我寄过来
from Colombia until next week.

85
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:09,130
比你早想到一步啦
One spicy step ahead of you.

86
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:11,420
有请塞拉诺辣椒
Enter the Serrano pepper!

87
00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:13,450
没人会知道区别的
No one will know the difference.

88
00:03:13,450 --> 00:03:14,650
我能
I will.

89
00:03:14,650 --> 00:03:16,990
这酱是我继承传统的一部分
This sauce is part of my heritage.

90
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:19,090
我不能背弃我的身份
I cannot turn my back on who I am.

91
00:03:19,090 --> 00:03:20,850
你的头发以前不是更深色一点吗
Didn't your hair used to be darker?

92
00:03:20,850 --> 00:03:21,990
我是说
I'm just saying

93
00:03:21,990 --> 00:03:25,390
这是推销我们的酱的大好时期
this is a great opportunity for our sauce.

94
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,840
我们的酱
"Our sauce"?

95
00:03:27,130 --> 00:03:30,160
突然间 小卡管它叫"我们的酱"了
All of a sudden, Cam is calling it "our sauce"?

96
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,100
这个配方是我伯祖母给我的
I got that recipe from my great aunt

97
00:03:32,110 --> 00:03:35,860
那可是她母亲从一个瞎女仆那里偷来后给她的
who got it from her mother who stole it from a blind maid.

98
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:37,180
他怎么敢这么说
How dare he.

99
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:39,850
好吧 我们就去弄点大红椒
Fine. We'll just go get some blood peppers.

100
00:03:39,850 --> 00:03:41,730
不可能买到的
They're impossible to get.

101
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:44,610
除非你愿意犯点法
Unless you're willing to break some rules.

102
00:03:44,610 --> 00:03:46,440
我们为什么说回你的事情了
Why are we back on your thing again?

103
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,090
正好有人在植物园里
They just so happen to grow blood peppers

104
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:49,030
种了大红椒
at the botanical gardens.

105
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:50,110
太好了 我们走吧
Great. Let's go.

106
00:03:50,110 --> 00:03:51,180
你太天真了
You're adorable.

107
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:53,530
我说的可是有被严密保护起来的珍稀植物
We're talking rare flora in a secure location.

108
00:03:53,530 --> 00:03:55,090
好吧 要怎么做
Okay, so, then what do we do?

109
00:03:55,090 --> 00:03:57,170
首先 为说我是个乖宝宝道歉
First, apologize for calling me a goody-goody,

110
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:59,260
因为我要说的这个计划
because I'm about to lay out a plan so daring

111
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:01,860
大胆到你们俩可能都不敢进行下去
that the two of you may not have the guts to follow it.

112
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,040
我要带刀吗
Should I take my knife?

113
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:04,630
我车里有棒球棒
I have my baseball bat in my car.

114
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:06,040
好了 我们要偷的是辣椒
Okay, we're stealing a pepper,

115
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,830
不是要教训它家人
not teaching its family a lesson.

116
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:08,990
好吧
Uh, okay.

117
00:04:08,990 --> 00:04:10,350
我注意到你们的一些教授
I noticed a few of your professors

118
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:12,220
坐在那种嘴巴控制的轮椅上
in those mouth-controlled wheelchairs.

119
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:14,900
我觉得他们有的只是假装看起来酷一点而已吧
I think some of them are just faking it to try and look cool.

120
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:19,020
我的个老天 机器人先生实验室
Domo Arigato, Mr. Robotics lab!

121
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:19,600
什么
What?!

122
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,770
对啊 来试试这里的手套 超赞
Yeah. Come check out these gloves. They're awesome.

123
00:04:22,770 --> 00:04:24,880
任何动作 即便是最轻微的动作
Any movement, even the slightest motion,

124
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,920
这些机器手都可以照做
will be mirrored by the robotic hands.

125
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,730
可能应用于拆弹
Possible applications are bomb defusement,

126
00:04:28,730 --> 00:04:31,990
核反应堆修复和远程神经手术
nuclear reactor repair, and remote neurosurgery.

127
00:04:31,990 --> 00:04:34,700
谁只用双指就能征服每一个女机器人呢
What has two thumbs and any lady robot he wants?

128
00:04:35,150 --> 00:04:36,030
这家伙
This guy.

129
00:04:36,030 --> 00:04:37,360
老爸 这不是玩具
Dad, this isn't a toy.

130
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:41,690
你们好 我忠实的机器仆臣
Hello, my loyal robot subjects.

131
00:04:41,690 --> 00:04:42,390
老爸
Dad?

132
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:43,540
爵士手
Jazz hands!

133
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:44,630
其他机器人在看呢
The other robots are staring!

134
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:46,270
对不起 对不起
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

135
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,920
最近家里怎么样
So, what's going on at home?

136
00:04:49,990 --> 00:04:52,070
海莉和卢克也不怎么在家
Well, Haley and Luke aren't around much.

137
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,520
而且鸭子超赞的 但是没人懂
Meanwhile, the ducks are awesome and nobody gets it.

138
00:04:54,570 --> 00:04:56,400
说了你可能不信 但有一只鸭子会捡东西了
You wouldn't believe this, but one of them can fetch.

139
00:04:56,410 --> 00:04:57,590
我当然信
Of course I believe it.

140
00:04:57,590 --> 00:04:58,330
我的一位教授
One of my professors

141
00:04:58,330 --> 00:05:00,550
教会一只猩猩演奏萨克斯风
taught a chimpanzee how to play the saxophone.

142
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:02,830
我们都觉得很厉害 但是它只会演奏爵士
We all think he's great, but he only plays jazz,

143
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:03,970
所以说不定也就那样了
so there's no way to tell.

144
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,700
跟我说说这些家伙
Tell me about these fellas.

145
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:07,710
这个是为军队设计的
Well, this one's being developed for the military.

146
00:05:07,710 --> 00:05:08,490
真的吗
Really?

147
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:11,280
那这个可爱的男孩子呢 开关你好 击个掌
What about this adorable guy? Hello, switch.

148
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,410
不 爸爸 别按那个
Oh, no! Dad, don't press that.

149
00:05:12,410 --> 00:05:13,620
他只是去散个步
Oh, he's just going for a little walk.

150
00:05:14,450 --> 00:05:15,230
总开关
The master switch!

151
00:05:15,230 --> 00:05:16,230
你说啥
The what?

152
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,040
不 不
No, no, no!

153
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,690
天哪
Oh, my god.

154
00:05:19,690 --> 00:05:20,640
真的发生了
It's happening!

155
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:21,720
它们造反了
They're rising up!

156
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:23,180
快关掉
Turn off!

157
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:24,830
我命令你们关掉
I command you to turn off!

158
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:25,420
关不掉了
It's not working!

159
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,660
我站在你这边
I'm on your side!

160
00:05:26,660 --> 00:05:27,650
你为什么要那么做
Why would you do that?!

161
00:05:27,650 --> 00:05:29,450
我不知道自己在想什么
I don't know what I was thinking!

162
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,780
真对不起
I'm so sorry.

163
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:37,530
很好 现在橄榄球队队长讨厌我了
Great. Now the captain of the football team hates me.

164
00:05:40,110 --> 00:05:42,270
听好 仔细按我说的做
Okay, follow my plan to the letter,

165
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:44,100
这样十分钟后辣椒就能到手了
and in 10 minutes, we'll have peppers in hand.

166
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,130
今天是周六
It's Saturday.

167
00:05:45,130 --> 00:05:47,150
威廉会在玫瑰园工作
William will be working the Rose Garden.

168
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:48,720
幸运的是 他不会注意到的
Fortunately, he'll be distracted.

169
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,620
现在 他眼里只有瓢虫
Right now, the aphids have the upper hand.

170
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:52,540
小卡 到了溪边之后
Cam, when you reach the stream,

171
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:55,440
沿着溪边朝东南方向到达蜂鸟展示园
follow it south southeast to the Hummingbird Exhibit.

172
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,850
不要跟任何人交流
Interact with no one.

173
00:05:56,850 --> 00:05:58,550
不好意思 能给我们照张相吗
Excuse me. Could you take this for us?

174
00:05:58,550 --> 00:06:00,580
这个时间我还是有的
Oh, guess I have a second.

175
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:03,230
我自拍了一张
Took a picture of myself.

176
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:05,550
现在成你的墙纸了
Oh, and now it's your wallpaper.

177
00:06:06,770 --> 00:06:09,840
老妈 以免被人怀疑 多绕点路
Mom, to avoid detection, take a circuitous route

178
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,700
去艾德蒙及米里亚姆拉比诺维茨辣椒园
to the Edmund and Miriam Rabinowitz Pepper Patch.

179
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,510
带我去大红椒那边
Take me to the blood peppers.

180
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:20,500
我去引开老年参观团
I'll re-route the senior citizens' tour...

181
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:22,800
你们已经参观过这边了 而且很满意
You've already been this way. You loved it.

182
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:25,920
这样你们到辣椒那边时他们不会出现
so they're not around when you arrive at the peppers.

183
00:06:27,330 --> 00:06:28,450
退下 少年
Go away, boy.

184
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,600
小心 可能会有额外警备
Be on alert. There may be added security.

185
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,330
真刺激
How exhilarating.

186
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:39,570
我都不知道我们的酱里还放了酸豆
I didn't know there was a caper in our sauce.

187
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:40,450
你怎么可能知道
How could you?

188
00:06:40,450 --> 00:06:42,130
配方又不是你的
It's not your recipe.

189
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:45,120
女孩们 要不要吃点零食
Hey, girls. How about a snack?

190
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:50,640
莉莉的越南舞蹈队要来我们家过夜
I'm hosting a sleepover for Lily's Vietnamese dance troupe.

191
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,970
我们希望她能更亲近自己的传统
We want her to be more in touch with her heritage,

192
00:06:52,970 --> 00:06:54,650
可是跟其他父母打交道
but breaking the ice with the other parents

193
00:06:54,650 --> 00:06:56,050
稍微有点困难
has been a little tough.

194
00:06:56,050 --> 00:06:57,790
小卡和我是父母中唯一一对白人
Cam and I are the only white parents,

195
00:06:57,790 --> 00:06:59,340
唯一一对同性爱人
the only gay parents,

196
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:01,220
也是唯一觉得我们有意思的
the only parents that find us funny.

197
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:05,110
快请进 帕特里夏 陈女士
Come on in, Patricia, Ms. Tran.

198
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:06,510
女孩们都在莉莉的房间
The girls are in Lily's room.

199
00:07:06,670 --> 00:07:08,170
真是有趣的巧合
Oh, this is a fun coincidence.

200
00:07:08,170 --> 00:07:10,640
我们昨晚刚跟另外一对陈夫妇一起吃过晚饭
We actually had a couple Trans over for dinner last ni--

201
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:13,330
最难打交道的当属
The hardest nut to crack

202
00:07:13,330 --> 00:07:15,600
小帕特里夏·陈的妈妈
has been little Patricia Tran's mother.

203
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:18,220
有次家庭聚餐我没有吃她亲手做的越南粉
I didn't try her homemade pho at a potluck once,

204
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:20,030
所以她现在讨厌我了
and now she doesn't like me.

205
00:07:20,130 --> 00:07:22,290
简直可以说是"掉粉"
You could say it was a little bit of a pho pa.

206
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,190
你好
Hello.

207
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:25,470
-你老公吗 -我爸
- Your husband? - My dad.

208
00:07:25,470 --> 00:07:27,620
我更喜欢深色头发没有小胡子的
And I prefer brunettes, without beards.

209
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,680
我喜欢女人
I like women.

210
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:31,030
我晚点会把帕特里夏的药拿来
I'll bring Patricia's medicine over later.

211
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,630
我的手袋
My purse.

212
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:36,700
她人看着挺好的
She seems nice.

213
00:07:38,010 --> 00:07:38,770
外公
Hey, Grandpa!

214
00:07:38,770 --> 00:07:40,080
亲爱的
Hi, sweetheart!

215
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,520
小贴士 你可以让这些女孩们
Little tip -- you might want the girls

216
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:42,620
把充气床吹起来
to blow up these air mattresses,

217
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:43,530
先消耗一点她们的精力
tire them out a little bit.

218
00:07:43,530 --> 00:07:45,190
我没想过消耗她们的精力
Oh, I'm not trying to tire them out.

219
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,420
不 我是个有趣的老爸
No. I'm the fun dad, okay?

220
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:47,750
我希望她们玩得开心
I want them to have a good time.

221
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:48,410
典型新手错误
That's a rookie mistake.

222
00:07:48,410 --> 00:07:49,430
你和克莱尔还小的时候
When you and Claire were kids,

223
00:07:49,430 --> 00:07:51,490
我是过夜派对之王 未尝败绩
I was the sleepover champ, undefeated.

224
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:53,790
所有孩子都会在7点半之前睡着
There was never a kid that was awake later than 7:30.

225
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,540
不 我记得我十岁生日那天
Oh, no. I remember my 10th birthday.

226
00:07:55,580 --> 00:07:56,500
你让我们给你洗车
You let us wash your car,

227
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:58,400
然后还把落地钟抬去丢掉了
and then we carried the grandfather clock to the dump.

228
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,100
晒太阳很重要
Yeah, sun exposure plays a big part.

229
00:08:00,100 --> 00:08:01,140
这些是什么
What's this stuff?

230
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:03,630
老妈给我寄了不少她车库里的东西
Uh, Mom, uh, mailed me a bunch of stuff from her garage.

231
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,940
她觉得我可能喜欢旧录像带
She thought I might like a VCR and a bunch of old tapes.

232
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:08,150
迪迪给你寄垃圾真让人感动
Sweet of Dede to mail you her garbage.

233
00:08:08,150 --> 00:08:10,670
《简·方达健身全集》《不是你 是他》
"Jane Fonda Complete Workouts," "It's Not You, It's Him",

234
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:11,370
《巧克力烹饪大全》
"Cooking with Chocolate."

235
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:13,090
基本上就是我们整个婚姻的艾前综合征
Pretty much the ARC of our whole marriage.

236
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:15,510
听着 如果你够聪明
Listen, if you're smart,

237
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,610
你会让女孩们把这些搬去捐掉
you'll let the girls walk this stuff down to Goodwill.

238
00:08:17,610 --> 00:08:19,680
或者我可以为我女儿的童年
Or I could provide a fun, entertaining evening

239
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:22,430
创造一个有趣的夜晚
that will only enrich my daughter's childhood.

240
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:24,350
二爸 你能做我们尖叫比赛的评委吗
Daddy, will you judge our screaming contest?

241
00:08:24,350 --> 00:08:26,600
当然了 加油哦 女孩们
Of course he will! Hit it, girls!

242
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:30,990
好吧 你们赢了 你们都赢了 平手
Okay! You won. You all won. It's a tie.

243
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:35,060
亲爱的 刚刚的事我真的很抱歉
Oh, honey, I am so sorry about what happened in there.

244
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:36,890
不用担心我 不过
Don't worry about me, but, you know,

245
00:08:36,890 --> 00:08:39,170
那些机器人的程序会让它们记仇
those robots are programmed to hold a grudge.

246
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:41,460
不过跟我计划的不同
Not how I wanted this to go.

247
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:42,230
大概要过很久
Probably gonna be a while

248
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:43,950
我才会再被邀请来这了吧
before I get invited back here, huh?

249
00:08:43,950 --> 00:08:44,850
老爸 没关系
Dad, it's okay.

250
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:48,150
反正你也会更常见到我
You're probably going to be seeing me a lot more,

251
00:08:48,150 --> 00:08:50,290
因为我打算搬回家
considering I want to move back home

252
00:08:50,290 --> 00:08:52,520
下学期走读
and commute to school next semester.

253
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,500
真的吗
Really?

254
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,940
是啊 反正开车只要半小时
Yeah. It's only a half-hour drive.

255
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,390
你生气了吗
Are you mad?

256
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:59,180
生气 怎么可能 我好兴奋
Mad? Are you kidding me? I'm thrilled.

257
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,060
我超级想你的
You know how much I miss you.

258
00:09:01,210 --> 00:09:02,970
我们可以在车库里建自己的机器人实验室
We could have our own robot lab in the garage.

259
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,730
那得花多少钱啊
How much could that possibly cost?

260
00:09:05,950 --> 00:09:09,180
可是 为什么呢 发生什么事了
But, uh -- but why? Did something happen?

261
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:11,060
没有 只是...
No, it's just --

262
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:14,100
这里的人太幼稚了
Ugh, the people here are all so immature.

263
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,550
他们老是用啤酒杯装着玛格丽特
They are always banging on your door

264
00:09:15,550 --> 00:09:17,860
来敲你的门 而且...
with a beaker full of margaritas, and...

265
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:20,350
那群书呆子烦得要命
The nerd noise is deafening.

266
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:23,140
你把我让老妈准备的降噪耳罩带来了吗
Did you bring those noise-canceling headphones I asked mom for?

267
00:09:23,140 --> 00:09:25,140
抱歉 我忘了
Oh, I am so sorry. I forgot.

268
00:09:25,610 --> 00:09:28,030
有时候我大脑会自动过滤你妈说的话
Sometimes my brain cancels out your mom's noise.

269
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,280
你上课的时候我去买一个
I'll, uh -- I'll pick some up

270
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:31,550
然后给你放到寝室来
while you're in class and then drop them by the dorm.

271
00:09:31,550 --> 00:09:32,450
谢谢
Thanks.

272
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,060
抱歉
Excuse me.

273
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,950
今晚是加农炮之夜 别错过哦
Cannon Ball tonight. Don't miss it.

274
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:37,380
不用了 谢谢
Oh, no, no. Thanks.

275
00:09:37,570 --> 00:09:38,600
那是什么
What's that about?

276
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,410
这里的一个愚蠢的传统
Oh, it's just some stupid tradition where,

277
00:09:40,410 --> 00:09:40,980
每学期结束的时候
at the end of the semester,

278
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:43,000
所有大一生都要穿着晚礼服裙
all the freshmen jump off a high dive

279
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,470
高台跳水
in cheesy prom dresses.

280
00:09:44,470 --> 00:09:45,700
应该很有趣
Oh, that could be fun.

281
00:09:45,850 --> 00:09:47,480
肯定不会
It definitely won't be.

282
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,820
不如你去试试看...
Well, maybe if you give it a chance...

283
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:49,960
不 老爸 我告诉你
No. You know what, Dad?

284
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,910
我去过了
I-I-I did.

285
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:53,130
我已经去过大概十个派对
I've -- I've already been to like 10 parties,

286
00:09:53,130 --> 00:09:53,770
都很无聊
and they're all lame.

287
00:09:53,770 --> 00:09:56,370
每个人都只跟自己室友聊天
Everyone just talks to their own dorm mate.

288
00:09:56,370 --> 00:09:58,550
亲爱的 有时候融入人群中是需要时间的
Sweetie, sometimes it takes a while to warm up to people.

289
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,940
讲这些干嘛 你不想让我回家吗
What is this about? Do you not want me to come home?

290
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:02,190
是因为这样吗
Is that what this is?

291
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:05,410
我自己在校园外租个公寓好了
Because, fine, I'll just go get an apartment off campus.

292
00:10:05,410 --> 00:10:06,270
艾丽克斯 别生气
Alex, don't get mad.

293
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,540
我气坏了
Well, I am mad.

294
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:08,930
因为我真的有自知之明
Because I'm actually smart enough

295
00:10:08,930 --> 00:10:10,510
我能看出什么适合我什么不适合
to know what's working for me and what isn't,

296
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:12,320
而这个就不适合
And this isn't.

297
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,640
我要去上课了
I have to go to class.

298
00:10:15,710 --> 00:10:16,780
小心 当心
Heads up! Watch out!

299
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,840
这也太神了吧
How'd he do that?

300
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,060
米奇尔
Mitchell?

301
00:10:23,070 --> 00:10:24,770
在厨房 外公
In the kitchen, grandpa!

302
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,980
越南女孩和一个浓妆男人
Vietnamese girls and a man in makeup.

303
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:29,340
鲍勃·霍普什么时候出来表演
When does Bob Hope take the stage?

304
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:30,090
真会说笑
Delightful.

305
00:10:30,090 --> 00:10:32,060
充气床垫弄好了
You're good to go on the air mattresses.

306
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:34,100
祝你今晚好运
Good luck with the sleepover.

307
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:37,550
怎么了 女士
Yes, Ma'am?

308
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:39,560
我不想再当有趣老爸了
I don't want to be the fun dad anymore.

309
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:41,600
我想让这些女孩快点累趴下
I need to knock these girls out quick.

310
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,920
快教我
Teach me.

311
00:10:45,930 --> 00:10:48,240
开始吧 女士们 伸高点
Let's go, ladies! Reach to the sky!

312
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,950
为什么你比简·方达还擅长这个
How are you better at this than Jane Fonda?

313
00:10:49,950 --> 00:10:50,910
米奇尔 你要是讲话
Mitchell, you can't talk

314
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:52,720
就感受不到脂肪燃烧了
and feel the burn at the same time.

315
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,660
使劲向外踢 珍妮弗
Donkey-kick like you mean it, Jennifer.

316
00:10:54,660 --> 00:10:57,290
我很好奇 这带子应该在前往慈善机构的路上
I'm just curious, because this tape was on its way to Goodwill,

317
00:10:57,290 --> 00:10:59,080
可突然间 你却从后口袋把它掏出来了
and all of a sudden, you pulled it out of your back pocket.

318
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,610
我胖了几斤
I put on a couple of extra pounds,

319
00:11:00,610 --> 00:11:02,890
简曾在八十年代帮我解决了这个问题
and Jane got me out of a similar situation in the ’80s.

320
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:05,120
你当时不会穿了暖腿套[女性瘦身操道具]吧
Please tell me you were wearing leg warmers.

321
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,150
别烦我
Leave me alone.

322
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,950
我们行的 孩子们 踏起步来
We got this, girls. March it out.

323
00:11:08,950 --> 00:11:11,170
且不论值不值 老爸 我是没看出来你胖了
Well, for whatever it's worth, Dad, I didn't notice.

324
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:12,340
歌洛莉亚看出来了
Gloria did.

325
00:11:12,610 --> 00:11:14,880
她用手戳了我肚子上的嘟嘟肉
She did that little poke thing to my spare tire.

326
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,580
莉莉 保持节奏
Lily, keep the beat.

327
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:18,720
我很不想承认 但这真的烦死我了
I hate to admit it, but it bugged the hell out of me.

328
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:21,740
金丽 这才是出拳和迈步的节奏
Kim-ly, we're punching and we're stepping.

329
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:23,020
能不能跟上
Care to join us?

330
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:27,220
我觉得我要每天都做这个锻炼
So, I figured I'd do this workout every damn day of the week

331
00:11:27,220 --> 00:11:30,130
直到我的肚臀腿遍布筋肉
until I was nothing but abs, buns, and thighs.

332
00:11:30,130 --> 00:11:32,030
屁股动起来 蒂芙尼
Work your glutes, Tiffany!

333
00:11:32,030 --> 00:11:33,600
这正是你要减的部位
This is your problem area.

334
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,820
好吧 老爸 无意冒犯
Okay, Dad, no offense, but I've been listening

335
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:38,540
但是自从你60岁时
to you whine about gaining and losing the same 10 pounds

336
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,370
娶了世界上最漂亮的女人后
since, at age 60,

337
00:11:39,370 --> 00:11:41,550
我就一直在听你讲这得而复失的几斤体重
you married the most beautiful woman in the world.

338
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:43,820
尽管我能理解这是有钱白人烦恼中
And while I appreciate what might be the rich-white-mannest

339
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:45,340
最有"有钱白人"特点的问题
of rich-white-man problems,

340
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:48,240
但这带子硬是把这些小女孩弄兴奋了
this tape is only energizing these little girls.

341
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,150
这好无聊
This is boring.

342
00:11:49,150 --> 00:11:50,920
我们去我房间搭堡垒吧
Let's go and build a fort in my room.

343
00:11:52,310 --> 00:11:53,420
所以怎样 你就这样放弃了
So, what? You're just gonna give up?

344
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:54,280
人得知道什么时候投降
You got to know when to surrender.

345
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,230
不 长官
No, sir.

346
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,680
我可不想一生两次输给越南人
I'm not losing to the Vietnamese twice in a lifetime.

347
00:11:57,690 --> 00:11:58,830
快起来
Get up.

348
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,680
谁都不能被落下[美军格言]
No man left behind.

349
00:12:00,780 --> 00:12:04,170
看这高尔夫球场 这会是鸭子们的美丽家园
Look at this golf course. It's a beautiful home for ducks.

350
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:06,230
来 谁要帮我
Okay, now, who's gonna help me

351
00:12:06,230 --> 00:12:08,120
把这些小混蛋放生了
set these little suckers free, huh?

352
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,050
-你放吧 -我不要
- You do it. - I'm good.

353
00:12:09,050 --> 00:12:10,630
给点力啊
Oh, come on.

354
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:12,710
我们都讨厌这些鸭子 想让他们消失啊
We all hate the ducks. We all want them gone.

355
00:12:12,710 --> 00:12:14,190
为什么我就得当那坏人呢
Why do I have to be the bad guy?

356
00:12:14,190 --> 00:12:15,370
我不知道 为什么我就负责貌美如花呢
I don't know. Why am I the pretty one?

357
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:16,270
我们都各有所长
We all have our thing.

358
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,760
好吧 好吧 我来吧
Fine. Fine. I'll do it.

359
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:22,550
快出来 这就好了 你们自由了
Get on out there. There you go. You're free. Okay.

360
00:12:23,330 --> 00:12:24,840
他们怎么哪儿都不去呢
Why aren't they going anywhere?

361
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:27,520
自恋小姐还在那儿做准备呢
Well, Miss Thing over there is still getting herself ready.

362
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:28,850
我发誓她一早上
I swear she spent all morning

363
00:12:28,850 --> 00:12:30,640
都在欣赏自己在碗里的倒影呢
looking at her reflection in the water bowl.

364
00:12:30,970 --> 00:12:32,450
那只怪胎呢
How about that weirdo?

365
00:12:32,450 --> 00:12:35,080
你们昨天有看到他嘴巴卡在笼子上了吗
Did you see when he got his bill stuck in his cage yesterday?

366
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,420
多可爱的小笨蛋啊
What a sweet little dope.

367
00:12:36,420 --> 00:12:39,050
我知道 还好他有个聪明的姐姐
I know. He's lucky his sister is so smart.

368
00:12:39,050 --> 00:12:41,040
她弄清了怎么打开笼子
You know, she figured out how to unlatch the cage

369
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,240
放他自由
and set him free.

370
00:12:45,170 --> 00:12:46,460
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

371
00:12:46,570 --> 00:12:48,660
你们明白这是什么情况了吗
Do you guys see what's happening?

372
00:12:49,220 --> 00:12:50,450
-没 -你们当然没看出来
- No. - Of course you don't.

373
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:52,790
你爸之所以这么痴迷于这些鸭子
The reason why your dad is so attached to these ducks

374
00:12:52,790 --> 00:12:55,100
是因为鸭子让他想起了你们
is they remind him of you guys.

375
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:56,580
我们得把他们带回家
We got to get them home.

376
00:12:56,970 --> 00:12:57,560
他们不见了
They're gone.

377
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:58,680
天啊
Oh, my god.

378
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:01,010
他们去哪儿了
Where are they?

379
00:13:01,570 --> 00:13:02,620
天哪
Oh, God.

380
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,640
搞什么
What the hell?

381
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,000
难道大家都把鸭子扔到这里吗
Does everyone get rid of their ducks here?

382
00:13:10,570 --> 00:13:12,170
我们能随便抓三只吗
Can't we just pick any three?

383
00:13:12,410 --> 00:13:14,020
你爸一眼就会看出来的
Your father will know immediately.

384
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:16,260
看 我觉得那只是卢克小笨鸭
Look. I think that might be the dumb Luke duck.

385
00:13:16,450 --> 00:13:18,220
在逗其他鸭子乐的那只吗
The one entertaining the others?

386
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:21,400
它的头被零食袋套住了
His head is caught in the Fritos bag.

387
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:22,620
-那不是你的鸭吗 -哪里
- Isn't that your duck? - Where?

388
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:25,410
那只用鸭嘴来回捣鼓麦子 想吃又不敢吃
The one pushing oats around with its beak, pretending to eat.

389
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,660
那就是了 去把鸭子抓回来 快去
All right. That's it. Go get your ducks. Go.

390
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:28,990
什么 不 水里又脏又浑的
What? No. It is filthy and filmy.

391
00:13:28,990 --> 00:13:30,700
而且卢克都还没下去呢
And that's before Luke even gets in it.

392
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:31,810
要是抓不到第三只鸭子
What's the point in getting two ducks

393
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:32,920
抓来两只又有什么用呢
if we don't have the third one?

394
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,570
我们要怎么找到艾丽克斯那只鸭呢
And how are we supposed to find the Alex duck?

395
00:13:34,570 --> 00:13:36,840
等到新年前夕 看看哪只待在家
Wait until New Year's Eve and see which one stays home?

396
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,070
不 不 你说对了
No. No. You're right.

397
00:13:38,070 --> 00:13:40,220
我们要集齐三只鸭子才能回家
We are not going home without all three ducks.

398
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:43,310
等等 看看你爸说的是不是真的
Hang on. Let's see if your dad was right.

399
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,670
小羽
Feather.

400
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:47,000
小羽 快去捡
Feather. Fetch.

401
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,750
怎么可能
No way.

402
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,190
不要干站着 快去抓你们的鸭子
Don't just stand there. Get your ducks.

403
00:13:53,190 --> 00:13:55,200
我刚花了一周的薪水买的这双鞋
I just spent a week's salary on these shoes.

404
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:57,760
我才不 瞧那双棕色的大眼睛
I'm not -- oh, look at those big brown eyes.

405
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,970
占了她半张脸呢
They take up half her face!

406
00:13:58,970 --> 00:14:00,350
我来了 小公主
I'm coming, princess!

407
00:14:02,350 --> 00:14:03,310
借过
Pardon me.

408
00:14:03,430 --> 00:14:04,990
抱歉 玩得开心
Sorry. Have fun.

409
00:14:09,170 --> 00:14:12,710
用铀做的最危险的饼是什么
What's the most dangerous type of uranium cake?

410
00:14:13,170 --> 00:14:14,310
黄饼[哈啰]
Yellow!

411
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,430
你怎么啦
What's going on?

412
00:14:18,470 --> 00:14:20,140
我捡到了个吸入器 你知道是谁的吗
I found this inhaler. Do you know whose it is?

413
00:14:20,140 --> 00:14:22,420
这儿只有六个人不用这个的
There's only six people here who don't use those.

414
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,300
他们毕业的时候会一起抛到空中
They throw them in the air at graduation.

415
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:25,370
好吧
All right.

416
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:27,220
你把降噪耳罩带来了吗
Hey, did you bring those headphones?

417
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,410
有 在这儿
Yeah. Right here.

418
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:29,480
谢啦
Thanks.

419
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:33,200
亲爱的
Hey, honey.

420
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,130
刚才的事很抱歉
I'm sorry about earlier.

421
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:39,590
回到大学校园可能让我想起了过去
I think maybe being on a college campus took me back,

422
00:14:39,590 --> 00:14:43,080
使我的新生焦虑感重现了
and some of my own first-year insecurities bubbled up.

423
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:47,640
我谁都不认识 而且无论我多努力
I didn't know anybody, and no matter how hard I tried,

424
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:48,810
我却始终是个局外人
I was always on the outside.

425
00:14:48,810 --> 00:14:51,900
然后突然有一天 不知为何 我融入进去了
And then suddenly, one day, something clicked and I was in.

426
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:54,160
我是说 这很难说的
I mean, you never know.

427
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,660
就算对你是这种情况
I mean, just because that happened to you,

428
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:56,840
-并不意味着 -不 不 不 不
- Doesn't mean that's -- - No, no, no, no, no.

429
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,580
我想说的就是这个
That's -- that's my point.

430
00:14:58,850 --> 00:15:00,680
你和我不一样
My story isn't your story.

431
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:03,240
虽然这地方令人生畏
As intimidating as this place may be,

432
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,790
但我从未见过你轻易向困难低过头
I've never seen you walk away from a challenge.

433
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,610
如果你说已经尽力了
If you tell me you've given it your best shot,

434
00:15:08,610 --> 00:15:10,090
那我相信你
then I know you have.

435
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:12,350
别生我的气好吗
So don't be mad at me, okay?

436
00:15:12,350 --> 00:15:13,690
我没生气
I'm not mad.

437
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:15,760
那就好 宝贝
All right, kiddo.

438
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:18,660
你妈妈和我下周会过来帮你收拾行李
Your mom and I will be back next week to pack you up.

439
00:15:18,930 --> 00:15:19,830
我爱你
I love you.

440
00:15:19,830 --> 00:15:21,120
我也爱你
I love you, too.

441
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:24,020
-再见 -再见
- Bye. - Bye.

442
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:41,430
好了 老爷爷礼品篮的卡车还有84分钟就到
Okay. Granddaddy's truck's gonna be here in 84 minutes.

443
00:15:41,430 --> 00:15:43,890
所以继续拧紧瓶盖 搅拌 切菜
So, we're tightening, we're stirring, we're chopping.

444
00:15:43,890 --> 00:15:44,630
快装瓶[克制]吧
Bottle it up!

445
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,350
我不行 太紧张了
I can't. I'm just too excited.

446
00:15:46,490 --> 00:15:48,490
你说得是把酱装瓶 明白了
you mean the sauce in the -- got it. Yes.

447
00:15:49,990 --> 00:15:50,730
小卡
Cam...

448
00:15:52,310 --> 00:15:53,400
-这是什么 -老天
- What is this? - Oh, my gosh.

449
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,300
这本不该让你看见的
You weren't supposed to see these yet.

450
00:15:58,670 --> 00:16:00,380
可这上面根本就没有我
But I am not even on it.

451
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:01,290
不 有你的 有你 你看
No, you are. Yes, you are. See?

452
00:16:01,290 --> 00:16:03,800
营养成分表这里有你的剪影
You're the silhouette right here by the nutritional facts.

453
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,080
这样 人们会关注你的身段
That way, people are looking at you

454
00:16:05,090 --> 00:16:07,080
就不会关注那些超剂量的钠了
and not the toxic amount of sodium.

455
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,120
我这还有别的样本
I have others, too.

456
00:16:08,130 --> 00:16:09,890
有一张是我们其中一个人坐着辣椒火箭
You know, I have one of us on a pepper rocket

457
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:11,540
冲向《酱料城》节目
on our way to Flavor City.

458
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:13,210
你在我前面 那张很可爱的
You're in front of me, and it's cute.

459
00:16:13,210 --> 00:16:15,790
我觉得咱俩的合作没戏
You know what? I don't think this partnership is working.

460
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,120
你说什么呢
What are you saying?

461
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,380
我说什么
What am I saying?

462
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,840
这是我家传的酱料
This is family's sauce,

463
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:23,150
而你已经试图更改配方
and you have already tried to change the recipe.

464
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:26,670
你连问都没问我就接了那么大个订单
You took a huge order without even asking me.

465
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:28,260
现在又来这一套
And now this?

466
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:32,570
如果要上《酱料城》 也是我自己上
If I am going to Flavor City, I am going by myself.

467
00:16:34,880 --> 00:16:36,220
你要跟我散伙[分手]吗
You're breaking up with me?

468
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:37,860
当我刚开始跟小卡约会时
When I first started dating Cam,

469
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,390
他的前男友就提醒过我
his ex-boyfriend gave me a heads up.

470
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:41,790
他说 小卡是个很好的人
He said, "Cam's a great guy,

471
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:43,850
我希望你永远别跟他分手
but I hope you never have to break up with him."

472
00:16:43,850 --> 00:16:45,630
我问他 为什么 他会生气
And I said, "Why? Does he get angry,

473
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:47,420
哭泣 嫉妒 沮丧吗
weepy, jealous, despondent?"

474
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:48,710
他说 是的
He said, "Yes."

475
00:16:49,530 --> 00:16:51,320
你要跟我散伙吗
You're breaking up with me?

476
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,190
这个合伙的主意是我想出来的
This business was my idea.

477
00:16:53,190 --> 00:16:55,040
是我带你去农贸市场的
I got you into the farmers' market.

478
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:56,720
是我让你的酱料被老爷爷品牌选中
I got you into those baskets.

479
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:59,400
我发现你时 你不过就是个家庭主妇
You were nothing but a housewife when I found you.

480
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:01,700
我没别的意思 我一直很欣赏你的
I didn't mean that. I've always admired you.

481
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:03,160
做家庭主妇是这世界上最难的工作
Being a housewife is the hardest job on the planet.

482
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:04,440
从来都没有休息的时间
You're never not at work.

483
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,140
只是 我们怎么会走到这一步的
It's just -- how did we get to this place?

484
00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:07,150
除非...
Unless...

485
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:09,380
你有别的合伙人了 是不是
There's someone else, isn't there?

486
00:17:09,710 --> 00:17:12,090
我怎么会这么傻呢
Oh, how could I be so blind?

487
00:17:12,090 --> 00:17:14,450
让我猜猜 那人经验更丰富吧
Let me guess -- somebody with more experience?

488
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:16,470
是个哥伦比亚人吧
Somebody Colombian?

489
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:18,590
你也轻松不了的
Well, you're no picnic, either.

490
00:17:19,490 --> 00:17:20,660
到底是谁
So, who is it?

491
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:24,890
说话啊
Say something!

492
00:17:25,850 --> 00:17:28,180
我见过我妈跟许多男人分手
I've seen my mom break up with a lot of guys.

493
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:30,970
她总是有魔力让他们把责任都包揽在自己身上
She has this weird power to get them to do all the work.

494
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:32,270
前一分钟 他们还很生气
One minute, they're a mess.

495
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:33,330
而后一分钟 他们就开始感谢她
The next, they're thanking her

496
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:34,960
说跟她在一起的时光是人生中最美好的
for the best year of their lives.

497
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:37,350
上一个分手的家伙还帮我们把行李搬到了杰家
The last guy helped us move into Jay's house.

498
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:38,110
你早就知道
You knew.

499
00:17:38,110 --> 00:17:41,380
你早知道我需要激励才能创造出属于自己的酱料
You knew I needed the motivation to create my own sauce.

500
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:42,760
你一直都知道的
You knew all along.

501
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,260
不客气的 小卡 别担心
You're welcome, Cam. And don't worry.

502
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:46,470
我知道总有一天 你自创的酱料
I know that one day, you're gonna have your sauce

503
00:17:46,470 --> 00:17:48,110
会被老爷爷礼品篮选中的
in Granddaddy's Basket.

504
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:49,650
这景倒是稀奇
Well, that paints a picture.

505
00:17:49,650 --> 00:17:51,790
你看 这里有很多东西都可以把孩子们累倒
Now, see, there's lots of stuff here to tire the kids out.

506
00:17:51,790 --> 00:17:54,510
可以搬砖 可以用铁铲挖土
Look -- bricks for carrying, shovels for digging.

507
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,510
铁铲 我们什么时候有铁铲了
Shovels. When did we get shovels?

508
00:17:55,510 --> 00:17:56,660
好了 不管你们在做什么
Okay, well, whatever you're doing,

509
00:17:56,670 --> 00:17:57,640
能不能麻烦你们换个地方
can you do it someplace else?

510
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,890
我在帮歌洛莉亚的酱料装瓶
I'm helping Gloria bottle her sauce,

511
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:00,360
我们就要来不及了
and we're running out of time.

512
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:01,630
小卡 我觉得已经来不及了
Ay, Cam. I think it's too late.

513
00:18:01,630 --> 00:18:03,820
剩下的时间不够了
I don't think we have enough time to finish.

514
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:04,970
或许可以
You might.

515
00:18:05,340 --> 00:18:07,400
陈女士 这是帕特里夏的药吗
Oh, Ms. Tran. Is that Patricia's medicine?

516
00:18:07,450 --> 00:18:09,130
加快速度 姑娘们
Pick up the pace, ladies!

517
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:12,120
快点 我们只剩下20分钟了
Come on! We've only got 20 minutes!

518
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:14,570
相信我 其实比看起来稍微好那么一点
Trust me. This is slightly better than it looks.

519
00:18:15,140 --> 00:18:16,510
我的手指头疼
My fingers hurt.

520
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:19,070
宝贝 我不是说了流水线上不能说话吗
Hey, honey, what did I say about talking on the line?

521
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:24,460
好吧 我们把这些鸭子尽快
Okay. Let's just get these ducks back into the garage

522
00:18:24,470 --> 00:18:25,940
放回车库 别出声
as fast as we can, and please be quiet.

523
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,490
-别让你父亲听见 -你们好啊
- I don't want your father to hear us. - Hello.

524
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:30,190
我提前回家了 看到你们六个
I got home early and noticed the six of you

525
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:32,790
不在家[鸭子出门]
had...ducked out.

526
00:18:32,830 --> 00:18:34,420
我们知道你有多爱这些鸭子
Well, we know how much you love the ducks,

527
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:36,510
而且我们也想跟他们一起玩
and -- and we wanted to play with them, too.

528
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:38,500
-而我们... -而什么 克莱尔
- And we -- - And what, Claire?

529
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:40,230
最疯狂的事发生了是吗
The craziest thing happened?

530
00:18:40,230 --> 00:18:43,290
你来了个急转弯 笼子门开了
You turned a hard corner, the cage banged open,

531
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,940
有一只鸭子碰到了天窗按钮
one of them hit the sunroof button,

532
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:47,550
他们就都飞出去了 只剩下一个空...
and out they flew, leaving us with nothing but an empty --

533
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:48,990
我打扰你们了 请继续
I interrupted you. Go on.

534
00:18:49,710 --> 00:18:51,680
虽然我们有时候不太喜欢这些鸭子 菲尔
We have not always loved the ducks, Phil,

535
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,910
但我们开始理解你了
but I think we're starting to get it.

536
00:18:53,910 --> 00:18:55,540
是啊 我们想让他们留下
Yeah. We want them to stay.

537
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,820
我们知道你为何爱他们了
We know why you love them.

538
00:18:56,820 --> 00:18:57,960
谢谢你们
Thank you.

539
00:18:58,250 --> 00:18:59,920
我一直都知道 这些小捣蛋们
I always knew it was only a matter of time

540
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,130
迟早会摇摇晃晃地走到你们的心里去
before these little scamps waddled into your hearts

541
00:19:02,130 --> 00:19:03,590
就像他们走进我的心一样
just like they did mine.

542
00:19:04,470 --> 00:19:06,560
现在来吧 帮我把他们从窗户扔出去
Now, come on. Help me throw them out the window.

543
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:09,310
老爸 你在干什么
Dad, what are you doing?

544
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:11,990
是时候该让他们离开了
It is time for them to go.

545
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:14,410
可是 亲爱的 你确定他们会飞了吗
But, honey, are you sure they can even fly?

546
00:19:14,410 --> 00:19:16,670
据网上资料所述 一个月前他们就该会飞了
According to the internet, they were ready a month ago.

547
00:19:16,670 --> 00:19:18,460
早餐时 你还给他们揉肩膀呢
At breakfast, you were giving them shoulder rubs.

548
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:19,430
出什么事了
What happened?

549
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:21,430
今天我意识到 可能是我拖他们后腿了
I realized today that I may have been holding them back

550
00:19:21,430 --> 00:19:22,960
因为他们是我的快乐
because that was fun for me.

551
00:19:23,450 --> 00:19:24,760
但到了最后
But in the end,

552
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:27,510
还是得放手让他们自由飞翔 不是吗
you got to let them spread their wings, right?

553
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:32,220
-加油 姑娘 -加油 艾丽克斯
- Whoo! Let's go! Girl! - All right, Alex!

554
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,640
好了 各位 我们开始吧
All right, guys. Let's do this.

555
00:19:37,870 --> 00:19:39,990
一 二...
One, two...

556
00:19:40,610 --> 00:19:42,220
要回来看我们哦
Come visit us!

557
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,140
别走错路哦
Make good choices!

558
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:04,140
从某种意义上说 是你们捡回了我
In many ways, you fetched me!

559
00:20:04,490 --> 00:20:05,650
被你发现了
You caught me.

560
00:20:06,470 --> 00:20:08,150
我知道他们不会回来了
I know they're not coming back.

561
00:20:08,710 --> 00:20:10,160
有时候会的
Sometimes they do.

562
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:13,410
喂
Hello?

563
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,720
艾丽克斯
Hey, Alex.

564
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,780
怎么样 宝贝
What's going on, sweetheart?

565
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:21,160
是吗
Yeah?

566
00:20:23,580 --> 00:20:26,290
当下面的弹簧铰链也固定好
"Once the lower spring hinge is secured,

567
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:29,460
就可以把衣橱门装上了
you can then attach the closet door."

568
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:35,050
她们都睡了 米奇
They're all sleeping, Mitch.

569
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:36,810
还不错
Not bad.

570
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:40,550
用时45分 还有进步的空间
45. Room for improvement.

571
00:20:43,230 --> 00:20:45,270
看来本王依旧立于不败之地
Well, it looks like I'm still undefeated.
